codex
I found two gaps in the probe’s claims: legal commands are tested only with word stores, and the “no resize attempted” check only recognizes the `0 x 0` warning. A valid-size resize can leave that check green. I’m also checking a vector-store path that may invalidate the packet’s claim that every guest write reaches the guard at full width.
